  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Proposed ground floor side infill extension, first-floor rear extension, internal alterations and all associated works at 85 Ritchings Ave, E17 6LD",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive scale, bulk, massing and elevated eaves line exceeding that of the original host dwelling, would fail to appear as a subordinate addition and would instead result in an overly dominant, visually intrusive and incongruous form of development that would harm the character and appearance of the host dwelling and surrounding terrace. The proposal would therefore conflict with Policies 53 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan - Part 1 (2024) and the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2010)."
  ],
